---@field agent_home? boolean
---@field agent_workspace? boolean May be silently dropped without effect in either direction (`validate_agent_workspace_update`, `settings_controller_support.rb`): turning it on is dropped unless the account is `agent_workspace_compatible?` and has `aw_self_serve_migration_enabled`, and (if Groups & Departments aren't migrated) dropped outright when the account has a Chat product, otherwise `groups.check_group_name_uniqueness` is forced to `true` as a side effect; turning it off is dropped if the account has native messaging or `aw_prevent_opt_out` without the auto-activation override. Setting it to `false` also forces `routing.enabled` to `false` (`settings_controller_support.rb:481-483`).
