---[Autocomplete Users](/api-reference/ticketing/users/users/#autocomplete-users) endpoints
---return when an external request omits `brand_id`.
---
---* `"0"` — customers in non-separated brands and all team members (default). A string,
---  matching the `brand_id=0` (account scope) value of the users endpoints.
---* `"default_brand"` — customers in the default brand and all team members. Falls back to `"0"`
