---@field actions? zendesk.AutomationInputActionsList|distilled.Null An object describing what the automation will do. See [Actions reference](/documentation/ticketing/reference-guides/actions-reference). `null` is accepted and treated as omitted
---@field active? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the automation is active. Defaults to `true`. `null` is accepted and treated as omitted
---@field all? zendesk.AutomationInputAllList|distilled.Null Logical AND conditions. Accepted as a top-level alternative to `conditions.all`. The automation must have at least one time-based condition and at least one condition that checks `status`, `type`, `group_id`, `assignee_id`, or `requester_id`. `null` is accepted and treated as omitted
