---@field position? number|distilled.Null The position of the automation, which specifies the order it will be executed in. `null` is accepted and treated as omitted, placing the automation last
---@field restriction? zendesk.AutomationInputRestriction|distilled.Null Who owns this automation. Set to `null` for the whole account. Not returned when reading an automation
