---@field rollup_filter_criteria? zendesk.CustomObjectFieldPropertiesObjectRollupFilterCriteriaMap|distilled.Null Roll-up fields only. Optional filter conditions (using `all`/`any` arrays) to restrict which child records are included in the aggregation. Uses the same DSL as lookup relationship filters

