---@field page? zendesk.ListUsersRequestPage Pagination parameter. Supports both traditional offset and cursor-based pagination: - Traditional: `?page=2` (integer page number) - Cursor: `?page[size]=50&page[after]=cursor` (deepObject with size, after, before) These are mutually exclusive - use one format or the other, not both.
---@field per_page? number Number of records to return per page. Note: Default and maximum values vary by endpoint. Check endpoint-specific documentation for limits.
