---Bulk-update mode: the attributes in `organization` are applied to **every** organization named by the `ids` or `external_ids` query parameter. One of those two query parameters is required in this mode — the request returns 400 without one. Both are query parameters, not body properties: a body schema cannot see the query string, so the requirement is stated here rather than encoded. At most 100 organizations can be updated in one request.
