---@field raw_title? string|distilled.Null The dynamic content placeholder for `title`. When a non-null value is sent it takes precedence over `title`. A `null` value is ignored and `title` is used instead. See [Dynamic Content](/api-reference/ticketing/ticket-management/dynamic_content/)
---@field regexp_for_validation? string|distilled.Null For `regexp` fields only. The validation pattern for a field value to be deemed valid. Required for `regexp` fields: a blank or `null` value is rejected for that type. Accepted and ignored for every other type, including as `null`
