---@field type? zendesk.OrganizationFieldInputType|string|distilled.Null The type of the organization field. Determines which other attributes are relevant (for example `custom_field_options` is required for `dropdown`, `tagger` and `multiselect`, and `relationship_target_type` is required for `lookup`). Defaults to `text` when omitted or `null`. Cannot be changed after creation. The `currency`, `url` and `parent` types are accepted by the API but rejected on validation, because they are only valid for custom object fields

