---@field brand_id? number The ID of the brand associated with this remote authentication configuration.
---@field can_display_button_to_end_users boolean If users can choose how they sign in, this remote authentication method appears as an option when it's active
---@field can_display_button_to_team_members boolean If team members can choose how they sign in, this remote authentication method appears as an option when it's active
