---@field trigger_ids zendesk.ReorderTriggersRequestTriggerIdsList The complete set of active ticket trigger ids in the account, in the firing order to apply. Each id's new position is its 1-based index in this array. The array must contain exactly the ids of every **active** ticket trigger in the account — no more, no fewer. A partial or padded list is rejected with a `400 Bad Request` ("Invalid attribute: all triggers are not provided") and nothing is reordered, so a generated call must first read the account's active ticket triggers and send all of them. Inactive triggers are not reordered and must not be included. An empty array is only accepted on an account that has no active ticket triggers; otherwise it is the same `400`. Omitting the property is not supported.

