---@field action? zendesk.RequestEmailCCInputAction "put" to add the email CC, "delete" to remove it. Defaults to "put", and any unrecognised value is also treated as "put"
---@field user_email? string|distilled.Null The email address of the user to add or remove as an email CC. Used to look the user up when `user_id` is absent
---@field user_id? zendesk.RequestEmailCCInputUserId The id of the user to add or remove as an email CC. Takes precedence over `user_email`
