---@field per_page? number Number of records to return per page. Note: Default and maximum values vary by endpoint. Check endpoint-specific documentation for limits.
---@field query? string The `query` parameter supports the Zendesk search syntax for more advanced user searches. It can specify a partial or full value of any user property, including name, email address, notes, or phone. Example: `query="jdoe"`. See the [Search API](/api-reference/ticketing/ticket-management/search/).
