---A condition set that shows and optionally requires child fields in the agent interface when a parent field
---holds a given value. Requires the account's native conditional fields feature; without it the `agent_conditions`
---array is silently ignored.
---@class zendesk.TicketFormAgentConditionObject
---@field child_fields zendesk.TicketFormAgentConditionObjectChildFieldsList The fields shown while the condition is active. Duplicate `id` entries are collapsed. An empty array is accepted rather than rejected — it creates no condition, and on an update it deletes every existing condition of this kind, because none are restated
---@field parent_field_id number The ID of the ticket field whose value activates the condition. Must be a field on this form, active, and of type `tagger`, `priority`, `tickettype`, `checkbox`, `textarea` or `text`
---@field value zendesk.TicketFormAgentConditionObjectValue The parent field value that activates the condition. For a `checkbox` parent field, send a boolean — any unrecognized value is coerced to false rather than rejected. For `priority` send a priority name, which is limited to `normal` and `high` on an account using the basic priority set. For `tickettype` send one of `question`, `incident`, `problem` or `task`. For `tagger` send the tag value of one of the parent field's options. Null is only accepted for a `checkbox` parent field, where it is coerced to false like any other unrecognized value. For every other parent field type a null is rejected

---@class zendesk.TicketFormAgentConditionObjectChildFieldsItem
---@field id number The ID of the ticket field to show. Must be a field on this form, active, and cannot be the `parent_field_id`
---@field is_required? boolean|distilled.Null Accepted but ignored on agent conditions. Whatever is sent is overwritten by a value derived from `required_on_statuses` — true when the type is `ALL_STATUSES` or when `solved` is among the statuses, false when `required_on_statuses` is omitted. Set `required_on_statuses` to control it. A null is accepted and ignored like any other value
---@field required_on_statuses? zendesk.TicketFormAgentConditionObjectChildFieldsItemRequiredOnStatuses|distilled.Null The ticket statuses on which the child field must have a value. Omitting it, or sending null, makes the field never required

---The ticket statuses on which the child field must have a value. Omitting it, or sending null, makes the field
