---@field regexp_for_validation? string|distilled.Null Regular expression field only. The validation pattern for a field value to be deemed valid
---@field relationship_filter? any A filter definition that allows your autocomplete to filter down results
---@field system? boolean If true, only active and position values of this field can be changed
---@field tag? string Optional for custom field of type "checkbox"; not presented otherwise.
