---@field type string The custom field type: "checkbox", "currency", "date", "decimal", "dropdown", "integer", ["lookup"](/api-reference/ticketing/lookup_relationships/lookup_relationships/), "multiselect", ["parent"](/api-reference/custom-data/custom-objects/custom_object_fields/#about-parent-relationship-fields) (custom objects only), "regexp", "text", or "textarea"
---@field updated_at? string The time of the last update of the field
---@field url? string The URL for this resource
