---@class zendesk.UserOrganizationMembershipInput
---@field organization_id number The ID of the organization to assign the user to. The organization must belong to the same account as the user. Creating a membership has effects beyond the new row: * If this is the user's first organization membership, it is created as the default, which also sets the user's `organization_id`, and every unclosed ticket requested by the user is reassigned to this organization. * On accounts **without** the multiple organizations feature, all of the user's other organization memberships are **deleted**, and the user's unclosed requested tickets that belonged to those removed organizations move to the user's new default organization — or have their organization cleared, if the account has the `unset_ticket_org_when_removing_default_user_org` feature. Tickets the user has in other organizations are left alone. * Returns a 422 if the user is already at the account's `max_organization_memberships_per_user` limit (300 by default).

